   "text": "Source: data/data.csv. Group labels were trimmed, correcting 19 labels with surrounding spaces. Mixed date formats were parsed as dates. Department and complaint labels are translated into English."
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "y": 2088,
   "x": 534,
   "w": 372,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Completion and before-doctor loss use all users in each group. Timing and follow-up summaries exclude missing values. All 2,164 missing durations correspond to incomplete consultations. Follow-up is missing for 186 users; platform is missing for 6."
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "y": 2088,
   "x": 936,
   "w": 372,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "The file does not describe the intervention or assignment procedure. Treat group gaps as observed associations, not established causal effects. A follow-up flag does not establish clinical quality. Investigate Dermatology and validate the experiment design before a rollout decision."
